# Hello, claude!
#
# A minimal single-member teamfile, fetched and seeded by `lmctl hello claude`.
# It's a connectivity check -- "is claude reachable in my environment at all?" --
# not a team you're meant to keep. Once it answers, either keep chatting
# (`lmctl chat`) or delete the file.
#
# Want a real teamfile instead of a one-off check? See
# https://lmctl.com/lmctl/docs/manuals/teamfile-format

_MEMBER_ alias=Lead provider=claude
